            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iki ni co cago Uhoraho azotēza amahanga yose azoba ateye Yerusalemu: inyama z’imibiri yabo zizobatikimirako bagihagaze, n’amaso yabo aborere mu nkombe zayo, n’indimi zabo ziborere mu kanwa kabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hag 2:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi Uhoraho azobaca umuhongo w’akaburarugero; maz’ umuntu wese asūmire ukuboko mugenzi we, abangure ukuboko arwane na mugenzi we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 39:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 12:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Abayuda bar’ i Yerusalemu bazorwana, maz’ ubutunzi bg’amahanga yose ahakikije buzorundanirizwa hamwe, amazahabu n’amafeza n’imyambaro, vyinshi vy’ itīti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ico cago nyene kizoba ku mafarasi no ku nyumbu no ku ngamiya no ku ndogoba no ku bindi bitungwa vyos bizoba aho bashagaje.",
