              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umuntu wese wo mu miryango yose yo kw isi atazodūga ngw aje i Yerusalemu gusenga Umwami Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, i wabo ntihazokoroka imvura; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
